meta {
  name: Get Follow-Up Pipeline (Cross-Lead)
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/follow-ups
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

params:query {
  ~assignedRepId:
  ~overdueOnly: true
  ~org_ids:
  ~campaign_type_ids:
}

docs {
  One row per lead with an open follow-up (followup_required stage + a
  scheduled time). isOverdue = scheduled_at < NOW() — the Leads page's
  "Follow-up Overdue" tile; the rest are its "Follow-up Due" tile.

  org_ids (CSV of uuids) is honoured only for a tenant/all lms.leads.view
  scope; anyone else is pinned to their session org whatever they send.
  Omitted by a tenant-wide actor = every branch in the tenant.
  campaign_type_ids (CSV) narrows further -- applied only for a holder of
  lms.leads.view.all_types, silently ignored otherwise; type visibility itself
  is RLS.
}
